<!doctype html><html lang="id"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Security — Hosting</title><style>body{background:#07111f;color:#edf5ff;font:15px system-ui;padding:24px}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto}a{color:#79b5ff}li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px;margin:8px 0;background:#102239;border:1px solid #29415d;border-radius:9px}button{background:#17304b;color:white;border:1px solid #426184;padding:8px 12px}p{color:#9cb0c9}</style><main><a href="../index.reic">← HOSTING</a><p>REIC MODULE / SECURITY</p><h1>Security</h1><p>Enam area fungsi. Mode pratinjau; tombol membuat catatan lokal, bukan menjalankan operasi server.</p><ol><li><b>1. Firewall</b><button data-a="Firewall">BUKA</button></li><li><b>2. WAF</b><button data-a="WAF">BUKA</button></li><li><b>3. Malware scan</b><button data-a="Malware scan">BUKA</button></li><li><b>4. Audit kerentanan</b><button data-a="Audit kerentanan">BUKA</button></li><li><b>5. Rate limiting</b><button data-a="Rate limiting">BUKA</button></li><li><b>6. Security events</b><button data-a="Security events">BUKA</button></li></ol><p id="status">READY</p></main><script>document.querySelectorAll("button").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{let k="pb-hosting-security",a=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(k)||"[]");a.unshift({action:b.dataset.a,at:new Date().toISOString()});localStorage.setItem(k,JSON.stringify(a));document.querySelector("#status").textContent="TERSIMPAN LOKAL: "+b.dataset.a});</script></html>